          <tr><td>k / v</td><td>{t('保留“读旧状态 / 写 residual”的语义', 'retain the read-state / residual-write semantics')}</td><td>{t('不把 sequence 张量逐字映射成参数张量', 'not a literal tensor-to-tensor mapping')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p>
      {t(
        '因此，我们并不是把完整的 Gated DeltaNet 原封不动搬到参数空间。第一版正式实验保留“长期 State + residual write + 动态 β”这三件事，但把',
        'We therefore do not transplant the full Gated DeltaNet into parameter space. The first formal study keeps persistent State, residual write, and dynamic β, while fixing',
      )}{' '}
      <MathFormula latex={math.alphaOne} display={false} />
      {t(
        '；这让实验只回答“控制新经验写入强度有没有帮助”，而不同时引入“主动遗忘旧参数状态”这个第二变量。',
        '. This isolates the question of controlling new-write strength without simultaneously introducing active forgetting of the old parameter State.',
      )}
    </p>

    <h3>2.4 {t('为什么不能直接在 LoRA 的 A / C 因子上做约束', 'Why the gate cannot operate directly on raw LoRA factors')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      '同一个 LoRA 有效更新可以用很多组 A / C 数值表示。只要 A 乘 s、C 除以 s，真正加到模型上的矩阵完全不变。也就是说，A / C 的数值大小带着“坐标选择”，不是我们真正想控制的学习量。',
      'The same effective LoRA update can be represented by many A/C factor values. Multiplying A by s and dividing C by s leaves the actual matrix update unchanged, so raw factor magnitudes contain coordinate choice rather than only learning content.',
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.gauge} label={t('LoRA 因子缩放不改变有效更新', 'LoRA factor rescaling leaves the effective update unchanged')} />
    <p>
      {t(
        '这也是为什么第一版“直接控制 LoRA 因子”的映射会失败：空历史起点的 C 侧检查给出',
        'This is why the first factor-space mapping failed: at the empty-history start, the C-side check produced',
      )}{' '}
      <MathFormula latex={math.factorFailureBeta} display={false} />
      {t(
        '，已经跑出合法区间；只修映射但继续沿用旧 β 控制器时，真实轨迹上甚至得到',
        ', outside the legal range; after fixing only the mapping but keeping the old controller, the real trajectory produced',
      )}{' '}
      <MathFormula latex={math.mappingFailureBeta} display={false} />
      {t(
        '。所以最终方法控制的是不受 LoRA 因子缩放方式影响的有效参数写入 ΔW，而不是 A / C 因子本身的位移。',
        '. The final treatment therefore controls a gauge-invariant effective write rather than raw A/C displacement.',
      )}
    </p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.beta} label={t('动态 beta 控制器', 'Dynamic beta controller')} compact />
    <p class="paper__math-caption">{t('冻结 controller · 只看局部参数 / 梯度 / Adam 状态，不看 reward、Task Score、Task Vector。', 'Frozen controller · local parameter / gradient / Adam state only; no reward, Task Score, or Task Vector.')}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.effective} label={t('本实验 β-gating（α 固定为 1）映射到参数 State 后的概念式', 'Conceptual parameter-State update for this β-gating (α fixed at 1) study')} compact />
    <p class="paper__math-caption">{t('这是参数空间里的概念式；实际 runtime 先写 C 得到真实 C1，再基于 C1 写 A。', 'Conceptual parameter-space form; runtime writes C first to obtain the actual C1, then writes A conditioned on C1.')}</p>
  </section>

