  </div>
  <p>{t(
    '最后 20 轮平均更接近“训练后期通常处在什么水平”，但它不是同题考试。下面的固定终评则让三组最终模型做完全相同、顺序相同的 128 题，同时给连续 Task Score 和完整做对数量。',
    'The last-20 mean is closer to typical late-training behavior, but it is not a same-task exam. The fixed final below evaluates all three final models on exactly the same ordered 128 tasks and reports both continuous Task Score and exact-success count.',
  )}</p>
  <div class="paper-table-wrap">
    <table class="paper-table">
      <thead><tr><th>{t('实验', 'Experiment')}</th><th>Task Score / 100</th><th>{t('完整做对', 'Exact success')}</th></tr></thead>
