    'The fixed final answers who completes more of this frozen panel, but it is still one set of 128 tasks rather than a comprehensive capability score. Ordinary OpenEVO remains an earlier predecessor run, not a third formal arm in the preregistered matched campaign below.',
  )}</p>

  {finalResult ? (
    <>
      <h3>4.4 {t('训练期成功率：只比较同设置正式对照的 Bounded 与 β-gating（α 固定为 1）', 'Training-period success: only the truly matched Bounded and β-gating (α fixed at 1) runs')}</h3>
