        'Mean training reward shows a positive difference, but the interval crosses zero and exact success does not improve. This supports only a transient positive signal, not a stable long-horizon gain, and it cannot stand in for the unrun dynamic-α + dynamic-β experiment.',
      )}</p>
    </>
  ) : <p>{t('正式结果尚未封存。', 'Formal result is not sealed.')}</p>}

  <div id="compute">
