</section>

<section class="paper__section" id="analysis" aria-labelledby="analysis-title">
  <p class="paper__section-number">5</p>
  <h2 id="analysis-title">{t('训练过程中发生了什么？从 loss 到行为变化', 'What changed during training? From loss to behavior')}</h2>
  <p class="paper__lede">{t(
    '分数现象已经在上一节先摆出来。这里再按“优化 → 参数大小 → Task Vector → 谱与方向 → 输出路径 → 行为分布”逐层往里看。每个指标都先解释它是什么，再放证据，最后才说它能解释到哪里。',
    'The score pattern is established first in the previous section. We now move inward in a fixed order: optimization → parameter magnitude → Task Vector → spectrum and direction → output path → behavior distribution. Each metric is defined before its evidence and interpretation.',
  )}</p>
  <p class="paper__links">
    <a href={wandbReportUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={wandbReportUrl} />{t('W&B Report（需要权限）', 'W&B Report (access required)')}</a>
    <a href={wandbWorkspaceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={wandbWorkspaceUrl} />{t('完整 W&B Workspace', 'Full W&B Workspace')}</a>
  </p>

  <div class="paper__metric-step" id="loss">
    <h3>5.1 loss：{t('训练有没有真的在拟合', 'did optimization actually fit the training records?')}</h3>
