    <p>{t(
      '这里的 loss 是 SD-LoRA trainer 在发生参数更新的轮次里记录的平均训练损失。它最适合回答“优化器有没有把当前训练记录拟合下去”，但它不直接等于 WebShop 做题能力。',
      'This loss is the mean SD-LoRA trainer loss on rounds that actually perform a parameter update. It answers whether the optimizer is fitting the current training records, not whether WebShop task performance is improving.',
    )}</p>
    <MetricEvidenceFigure item={metricCharts.loss} />
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('② 这次实验的结果', '② Result in this experiment')}</p>
    <div class="paper-table-wrap">
      <table class="paper-table">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('实验', 'Experiment')}</th><th>R0 loss</th><th>R159 loss</th><th>{t('缺失更新轮', 'missing update rounds')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>{names.baseline}</td><td>{lossFirst.ordinary_openevo_loss?.toFixed(3)}</td><td><strong>{lossLast.ordinary_openevo_loss?.toFixed(3)}</strong></td><td>{lossEvidence.missing_loss_points.ordinary_openevo}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.bounded}</td><td>{lossFirst.bounded_loss?.toFixed(3)}</td><td><strong>{lossLast.bounded_loss?.toFixed(3)}</strong></td><td>{lossEvidence.missing_loss_points.bounded}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.gdr}</td><td>{lossFirst.bounded_gdr_loss?.toFixed(3)}</td><td><strong>{lossLast.bounded_gdr_loss?.toFixed(3)}</strong></td><td>{lossEvidence.missing_loss_points.bounded_gdr}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
      '三条线的 loss 都从大约 1.05 降到 0.05–0.10 量级，说明训练过程本身没有“完全没学进去”。Bounded / β-gating 的末轮 loss 还低于普通 OpenEVO，但固定 128 题终评并没有因此更高。所以 loss 能排除明显的优化失败，却不能解释最终能力差异。',
      'All three losses fall from about 1.05 to the 0.05–0.10 range, so the runs did not simply fail to optimize. Bounded and β-gating even finish with lower loss than ordinary OpenEVO, yet their fixed-panel finals are not higher. Loss rules out an obvious optimization failure but does not explain the capability gap.',
    )}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="paper__metric-step" id="norms">
    <h3>5.2 {t('范数：长期 State 和本轮更新到底有多大', 'Norms: how large are the long-term State and the current update?')}</h3>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('① 指标是什么', '① What is the metric?')}</p>
    <p>{t(
      'Frobenius norm 可以把一个参数矩阵的总体大小压成一个数。这里先只问最简单的“有多大”：长期 State 多大、本轮 Task Vector 多大；先不讨论方向。',
      'The Frobenius norm compresses the overall magnitude of a parameter matrix into one number. We first ask only the simplest question—how large is the long-term State and how large is the current Task Vector—without yet discussing direction.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__chart-note">{t(
      '这里的 State / Final Task Vector 几何表只来自后两组同设置正式对照；普通 OpenEVO 是更早的前序实验，不在这份成对参数 State 快照里。下一节会用它自己的逐轮 Task Vector 数据做趋势与相关性诊断。',
      'This State / Final Task Vector geometry table comes only from the latter two matched formal runs. Ordinary OpenEVO is an earlier predecessor run and is not part of this paired parameter-State snapshot; the next section uses its own per-round Task Vector history for trend and association diagnostics.',
