    <p>{t(
      'Task Vector 是一轮训练前后的参数差。W&B 曲线先展示 160 轮 Frobenius 大小；随后再问这个大小和 Task Score 的相关关系是不是在去掉共同训练趋势以后仍然存在。',
      'A Task Vector is the parameter difference across one training round. The W&B curve first shows its 160-round Frobenius magnitude; we then ask whether its relationship with Task Score survives after removing the shared training trend.',
    )}</p>
    <MetricEvidenceFigure item={metricCharts.taskVector} />
    <p class="paper__chart-note">{t(
      '采样口径：三条曲线都使用 R0–R159 的逐轮 Task Vector Frobenius，每条 160 个点，横轴密度和 y 轴量程完全一致。网页发布图按封存逐轮数据统一采样；W&B 链接保留原始观测入口。下面的相关性统计只针对普通 OpenEVO 的 160 轮配对数据；另外两条曲线在这里用于比较逐轮更新幅度。',
      'Sampling: all three curves use per-round Task Vector Frobenius over R0–R159, with 160 points per curve and a shared x-density and y-scale. The publication figure normalizes sampling from sealed per-round evidence, while the W&B link preserves the original observability surface. The association statistics below use only the 160 paired rounds from ordinary OpenEVO; the other two curves are shown here for per-round update-magnitude comparison.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('② 这次实验的结果', '② Result in this experiment')}</p>
    <div class="paper-table-wrap">
      <table class="paper-table">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('Task Vector 诊断', 'Task Vector diagnostic')}</th><th>{t('结果', 'Result')}</th></tr></thead>
