          <tr><td>{names.bounded} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyScore * 100).toFixed(2)}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.bounded} · R128–159</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateScore * 100).toFixed(2)}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.gdr} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyScore * 100).toFixed(2)}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.gdr} · R128–159</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td><strong>{(study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore * 100).toFixed(2)}</strong></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <MetricEvidenceFigure item={metricCharts.steps} />
    <p>{t('β-gating（α 固定为 1）在 R96–127 → R128–159：', 'β-gating (α fixed at 1), R96–127 → R128–159:')} {t('每步 tokens', 'tokens/step')} <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midStepTokens.toFixed(1)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong> · {t('episode tokens', 'episode tokens')} <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong> · {t('平均步骤', 'mean steps')} <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midSteps.toFixed(2)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong> · Task Score / 100 <strong>{(study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midScore * 100).toFixed(2)} → {(study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore * 100).toFixed(2)}</strong></p>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
      '所以后期掉分不是“每一步突然更啰嗦”。更直接的行为变化是：每一步长度差不多，但需要走更多步，整条 episode 输出又变长。也就是说，变化更像任务路径重新变长，而不是单步回答膨胀。',
      'The late drop is therefore not “each step suddenly becomes more verbose.” The clearer behavioral change is that individual steps stay similar in length while more steps are needed and total episode output grows again. The task path lengthens rather than individual responses simply inflating.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__links"><a href="/research/seed-openevo/evidence/wandb-threeway/output-length-analysis.json">{t('160 轮完整长度 / 步数 JSON →', 'Full 160-round length / step JSON →')}</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="paper__metric-step" id="entropy">
    <h3>5.6 Entropy：{t('最后看策略行为是不是越来越集中', 'finally, is policy behavior becoming more concentrated?')}</h3>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('① 指标是什么', '① What is the metric?')}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '这里能可靠重建的是 action-family Shannon entropy：把 search、click 等有效动作类型的分布压成一个数。entropy 越低，表示策略越来越集中在少数几类动作上。它不是语言模型 token entropy，因为正式 rollout 没有保存逐 token logits / logprobs。',
      'What can be reconstructed reliably is action-family Shannon entropy over valid action types such as search and click. Lower entropy means the policy is concentrating on fewer action families. This is not language-model token entropy because the formal rollouts did not persist per-token logits/logprobs.',
    )}</p>
    <MetricEvidenceFigure item={metricCharts.entropy} />
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('② 这次实验的结果', '② Result in this experiment')}</p>
    <p class="paper__chart-note">{t(
      'R159 的 search / click 用有效动作占比表示，而不是直接比较原始计数；三组这一轮的总动作数不同，原始计数不能横向当作策略偏好强弱。',
      'R159 search / click are shown as shares of valid actions rather than raw counts. The three methods have different total action counts in that round, so raw counts are not directly comparable as policy preference.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="paper-table-wrap">
      <table class="paper-table paper-table--dense-results">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('方法', 'Method')}</th><th>R0–31 mean H</th><th>R128–159 mean H</th><th>R159 H</th><th>{t('R159 search 占比', 'R159 search share')}</th><th>{t('R159 click 占比', 'R159 click share')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>{names.baseline}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryEarly.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryLate.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.entropy.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.search / study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.click / study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.bounded}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedEarly.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedLate.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.entropy.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.search / study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.click / study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{names.gdr}</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrEarly.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrLate.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.entropy.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td>{(study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.search / study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</td><td><strong>{(study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.click / study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</strong></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
      'β-gating（α 固定为 1）的行为 entropy 明显下降，而且 R159 的有效动作更集中在 click；三组 valid action rate 都是 100%。这说明变化来自有效策略行为本身越来越集中，不是 parser 错误。但它和掉分只是同时出现，目前不能写成“低 entropy 导致掉分”。',
      'For β-gating (α fixed at 1), action entropy falls substantially and R159 valid actions are more concentrated on click; valid-action rate is 100% for all three methods. The policy itself is becoming more concentrated rather than failing parsing, but this remains co-occurrence rather than evidence that low entropy causes the score drop.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__links"><a href="/research/seed-openevo/evidence/wandb-threeway/action-family-entropy.json">{t('160 轮完整行为 entropy JSON →', 'Full 160-round action-entropy JSON →')}</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="paper__analysis-summary" id="analysis-boundary">
    <h3>5.7 {t('我们现在能解释到哪里？', 'How far can the evidence explain the late change?')}</h3>
    <p><strong>{t('确定看到的：', 'Observed: ')}</strong>{t(
      'β-gating 后期 Task Score 回落、任务路径重新变长、更新方向与 Bounded 明显分开，同时 action-family entropy 更集中。',
      'late β-gating Task Score declines, task paths lengthen again, update direction separates from Bounded, and action-family entropy becomes more concentrated.',
    )}</p>
    <p><strong>{t('已经排除的简单解释：', 'Simple explanations ruled out: ')}</strong>{t(
      '不是 trainer 完全没优化进去，不是单纯把同一方向更新缩小一点，也不是每一步输出突然变得更长，更不是非法动作增加。',
      'the trainer did not simply fail to optimize; the change is not just a slightly smaller update in the same direction; individual steps do not suddenly become longer; and invalid actions do not increase.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary"><strong>{t('还不能证明的：', 'Not demonstrated: ')}</strong>{t(
      '目前没有证据把 Task Vector、norm、cosine、谱或 entropy 中任何一个单独指标认定为掉分的直接原因。它们现在是解释候选和后续实验线索，不是因果结论。',
      'no single Task Vector, norm, cosine, spectral, or entropy metric is established as the direct cause of the score decline. They are diagnostic candidates and leads for follow-up experiments, not causal conclusions.',
    )}</p>
  </div>
</section>

  <section class="paper__section" id="next-question" aria-labelledby="next-question-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">6</p>
    <h2 id="next-question-title">{t('动态 α + 动态 β：尚未运行', 'Dynamic α + dynamic β: not run yet')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '这条指标链给出的顺序很清楚：loss 先说明优化过程不是简单坏掉；Frobenius norm 再看参数变化有多大；Task Vector 的相关性与谱 / 方向继续追问“大小是否对应分数、更新往哪里走”；最后才用长度、步数和 entropy 看更接近任务行为的变化。但这些后分析都不能补上一个根本缺口：这次正式实验始终把 α 固定为 1。',
      'The diagnostic ladder is explicit: loss first checks that optimization did not simply fail; Frobenius norm asks how large the parameter changes are; Task Vector association plus spectrum/direction asks whether magnitude tracks score and where updates move; length, steps, and entropy then examine behavior closer to the task. None of these post-hoc analyses fill the basic missing experiment: α remained fixed at 1 throughout this formal study.',
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '所以第一条新实验应该是动态 α + 动态 β；它现在仍然是空位。第二条问题才是 β controller 还应该知道什么，例如 layer、round 或历史更新方向。已经看过的 Final 不能反过来用来调当前封存实验。',
      'The first new experiment should therefore be dynamic α + dynamic β, which remains an empty slot. Only after that comes the question of what additional information the β controller should observe, such as layer, round, or historical update direction. The completed Final cannot be used retrospectively to tune this sealed experiment.',
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="paper__section" id="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">7</p>
    <h2 id="evidence-title">{t('证据与复现身份', 'Evidence and reproducibility identity')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '正文把已完成的第三组明确写成“Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating（α 固定为 1）”，不再把它当作完整 GDR。“动态 α + 动态 β”只作为未做实验位置保留。为了审计，底层正式身份仍原样保留：普通 OpenEVO 对应历史 DirectApply / No-GDR；后两组正式实验标识仍是 BOUNDED_OFF 与 EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_V1。',
      'The completed third line is named explicitly as “Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating (α fixed at 1)” rather than presented as full GDR. Dynamic α + dynamic β is kept only as an unrun slot. For auditability, the underlying formal identities remain unchanged: ordinary OpenEVO maps to the historical DirectApply / No-GDR run, and the matched formal identities remain BOUNDED_OFF and EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_V1.',
    )}</p>
    <details class="paper__details paper__experiment-hub" data-experiment-hub>
      <summary>{t('本实验的结果、分析与证据', 'Results, analysis, and evidence for this experiment')}</summary>
      <p data-hub-motivation><strong>{t('为什么做：', 'Why this experiment: ')}</strong>{experiment.motivation[locale]}</p>
      <div class="paper__hub-grid">
        <div data-hub-group="result">
          <h3>{t('结果', 'Result')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubResults.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div data-hub-group="analysis">
          <h3>{t('分析', 'Analysis')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubAnalyses.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div data-hub-group="evidence">
          <h3>{t('证据 / 历史', 'Evidence / history')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubEvidence.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="paper__details" open>
      <summary>{t('正式结果与同题 Final', 'Formal results and same-panel final')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.finalComparison}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.finalComparison} />{t('三组同题冻结终评 / Bounded Online Recurrence 与 β-gating（α 固定为 1）正式比较', 'three-way same-panel final / formal Bounded Online Recurrence vs β-gating (α fixed at 1) comparison')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.longHorizon}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.longHorizon} />{t('长期统计与 bootstrap', 'long-horizon statistics and bootstrap')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.publicSnapshot}>{t('公开机器可读结果快照', 'public machine-readable snapshot')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.posthocAnalysis.snapshot}>{t('只读后分析快照', 'read-only post-hoc snapshot')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details class="paper__details">
      <summary>{t('方法实现与资格证据', 'Method implementation and qualification evidence')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.gaugeInvariantPolicy}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.gaugeInvariantPolicy} />gauge-invariant β policy</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.stepTrace}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.stepTrace} />exact per-step trace</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.finalCloseout}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.finalCloseout} />{t('最终收口记录', 'final closeout')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={directApplyHref}>{t('普通 OpenEVO 独立实验页', 'ordinary OpenEVO experiment')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={boundedHref}>{t('Bounded State 早期研究页', 'Bounded State research page')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </section>
</article>

